<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kinross Dec qtr op income up, output steady.</title>
<headline>Kinross Dec qtr op income up, output steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  9.10 vs  5.67</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			2,375  vs 2,321</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated	     405,000  vs 403,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    5.9  vs 5.8</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			 46,464  vs 47,530</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		    55,805  vs 55,153</p>
<p>Full name: Kinross divisions of Evander Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company, which has merged with Leslie and Winkelhaak in Evander Gold Mines Ltd, reported an operating income of 22.52 million rand from the 17,76 in the previous quarter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
